  40:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** /*
  41:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * @brief  Weights Table
  42:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** */
  43:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** 
  44:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** /**
  45:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * \par
  46:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * Weights tables are generated using the formula : <pre>weights[n] = e^(-j*n*pi/(2*N))</pre>
  47:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * \par
  48:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * C command to generate the table
  49:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * <pre>
  50:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * for(i = 0; i< N; i++)
  51:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * {
  52:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  *   weights[2*i]= cos(i*c);
  53:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  *   weights[(2*i)+1]= -sin(i * c);
  54:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * } </pre>
  55:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * \par
  56:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * where <code>N</code> is the Number of weights to be calculated and <code>c</code> is <code>pi/(2
  57:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * \par
  58:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * Converted the output to q15 format by multiplying with 2^31 and saturated if required.
  59:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * \par
  60:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * In the tables below the real and imaginary values are placed alternatively, hence the
  61:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  * array length is <code>2*N</code>.
  62:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c ****  */
  63:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** 
