2797:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** /**
2798:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * \par
2799:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * cosFactor tables are generated using the formula : <pre> cos_factors[n] = 2 * cos((2n+1)*pi/(4*N)
2800:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * \par
2801:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * C command to generate the table
2802:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * <pre>
2803:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * for(i = 0; i< N; i++)
2804:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * {
2805:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** *   cos_factors[i]= 2 * cos((2*i+1)*c/2);
2806:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * } </pre>
2807:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * \par
2808:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * where <code>N</code> is the number of factors to generate and <code>c</code> is <code>pi/(2*N)</c
2809:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * \par
2810:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** * Then converted to q15 format by multiplying with 2^31 and saturated if required.
2811:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** 
2812:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_dct4_init_q15.c **** */
